  description: 'This card''s name becomes "Great Sand Sea - Gold Golgonda" while
    on the field or in the GY. Once per turn, if a card(s) you control would be destroyed
    by battle or card effect, you can send 1 Fusion Monster that mentions "Fallen
    of Albaz" as material from your Extra Deck to the GY, instead. During the End
    Phase, if you have "Fallen of Albaz" on your field or in your GY: You can Special
    Summon 1 "Springans" monster from your hand or Deck. You can only use this effect
    of "Decisive Battle of Golgonda" once per turn.'
